%% Secrets Management System - Data Flow Sequence
%% User Story: US-005
%% Description: Detailed sequence diagram showing secret retrieval flow

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application
    participant SS as SecretsService
    participant Cache as Memory Cache
    participant Config as Config
    participant AWS as AWS Secrets Manager
    participant ENV as Environment Variables

    Note over App,ENV: Initialization Phase
    App->>SS: initialize()
    SS->>Config: getSecretsConfig()
    Config-->>SS: config (useAwsSecrets, region, etc)

    alt useAwsSecrets = true
        SS->>AWS: Create SecretsManagerClient
        AWS-->>SS: Client ready
        Note over SS: AWS mode enabled
    else useAwsSecrets = false
        Note over SS: Development mode (env vars)
    end

    SS-->>App: Initialized

    Note over App,ENV: Secret Retrieval Phase
    App->>SS: getSecret('JWT_SECRET')

    SS->>Cache: get('JWT_SECRET')
    alt Cache Hit
        Cache-->>SS: Cached value
        SS-->>App: Secret value
        Note over SS: <1ms response time
    else Cache Miss
        Cache-->>SS: null

        alt Production/Staging Mode
            SS->>Config: Find secret mapping
            Config-->>SS: secretName: 'sovren/prod/auth/jwt-secret'

            SS->>AWS: GetSecretValueCommand
            AWS->>AWS: Verify IAM permissions
            AWS->>AWS: Retrieve secret

            alt AWS Success
                AWS-->>SS: SecretString or SecretBinary
                SS->>SS: Parse JSON if needed
                SS->>Cache: Store with TTL (3600s)
                Cache-->>SS: Stored
                SS-->>App: Secret value
                Note over SS: 50-200ms response time
            else AWS Error (Transient)
                AWS-->>SS: NetworkError
                SS->>SS: Retry with backoff
                SS->>AWS: Retry GetSecretValueCommand
                Note over SS: Exponential backoff
            else AWS Error (Not Found)
                AWS-->>SS: ResourceNotFoundException
                SS->>ENV: Fallback to process.env
                ENV-->>SS: Environment value or empty
                SS->>Cache: Store fallback value
                SS-->>App: Fallback value or error
            end

        else Development Mode
            SS->>ENV: process.env.JWT_SECRET
            ENV-->>SS: Environment value
            SS->>Cache: Store with TTL
            SS-->>App: Secret value
            Note over SS: <1ms response time
        end
    end

    Note over App,ENV: Batch Retrieval (Optimized)
    App->>SS: getSecrets(['JWT_SECRET', 'DB_URL'])
    par Parallel Retrieval
        SS->>SS: getSecret('JWT_SECRET')
        and
        SS->>SS: getSecret('DB_URL')
    end
    SS-->>App: { JWT_SECRET: '...', DB_URL: '...' }

    Note over App,ENV: Cache Refresh
    App->>SS: refreshSecrets()
    SS->>Cache: clear()
    Cache-->>SS: Cleared
    loop For each configured secret
        SS->>AWS: GetSecretValue
        AWS-->>SS: Updated value
        SS->>Cache: Store
    end
    SS-->>App: Refresh complete
